OL,3,GNEWSASchool seeks music space after
OL,4,ASEND expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Dorset school has submitted plans for
OL,7,Fa new music building after converting
OL,8,Fits specialist music classroom into an
OL,9,Finclusion base to help meet growing
OL,10,Fdemand for children with special
OL,11,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,12,F(SEND).
OL,14,FCanford Heath Infant School in Poole
OL,15,Fwants to install a modular building
OL,16,Fwith two teaching rooms for visiting
OL,17,Fmusic teachers, according to the Local
OL,18,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
