OL,3,GNEWSASchool seeks music space after
OL,4,ASEND expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school said that the move expanded
OL,7,FSEND provision and reflected reforms to
OL,8,Fthe system, but meant that music
OL,9,Flessons were moved into regular
OL,10,Fclassrooms.
OL,12,FThe TEACH trust said that it viewed
OL,13,Fmusic as integral to every child's
OL,14,Facademic journey.
